(6995351, 1056928, 53147, '<td valign="top">I see the smoke and it certainly is different than most of the images I have voted on so far. But it just seems lacking for some reason. Cant put my finger on it though.</td>', 'I see the smoke and it certainly is different than most of the images I have voted on so far. But it just seems lacking for some reason. Cant put my finger on it though.', '2013-03-08 12:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
