(6995356, 1057025, 53147, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to set aside my cigars and pull out my pipe. I can smell the sweetness right now. Edit choice was good on this one.</td>', 'Makes me want to set aside my cigars and pull out my pipe. I can smell the sweetness right now. Edit choice was good on this one.', '2013-03-08 12:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
