(6995359, 1057074, 49954, '<td valign="top">Burn baby burn!  Disco Inferno!  Meets the challenge in that there is smoke, but the fire is bit harsh and not really much to look at.</td>', 'Burn baby burn!  Disco Inferno!  Meets the challenge in that there is smoke, but the fire is bit harsh and not really much to look at.', '2013-03-08 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995361, 1057011, 153814, '<td valign="top">Your different approach with the white backgroung and the dark smoke was a great idea. You really separated your self from the pack in a good way.<br/>Lots here for me to see curves, swirles, great contrast, some color mixed in, and what looks to me like two people dancing on the left side. I hope this does well. Great job on this.</td>', 'Your different approach with the white backgroung and the dark smoke was a great idea. You really separated your self from the pack in a good way.Lots here for me to see curves, swirles, great contrast, some color mixed in, and what looks to me like two people dancing on the left side. I hope this does well. Great job on this.', '2013-03-08 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995362, 1057088, 153814, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and a great shot.<br/>well done.</td>', 'Cool idea and a great shot.well done.', '2013-03-08 12:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995363, 1056675, 49954, '<td valign="top">The cigarette itself is aces.  The texture, the height, everything on it works.  The smoke, albeit real I''m sure, looks fake to me.  Like you took the pen tool and did a bit of a scribble.  It distracts and it''s supposed to be the star.  Had the theme just been "Smoke" without the description of "where smoke plays a major role" I''d have scored this higher, because a cig is "a smoke" as well... but the description makes it clear that the burning smoke is what is to be the star.  Anyway, it''s still a great shot and it includes smoke, so I''m not saying DNMC, just that it could have been stronger. IMO.</td>', 'The cigarette itself is aces.  The texture, the height, everything on it works.  The smoke, albeit real I''m sure, looks fake to me.  Like you took the pen tool and did a bit of a scribble.  It distracts and it''s supposed to be the star.  Had the theme just been "Smoke" without the description of "where smoke plays a major role" I''d have scored this higher, because a cig is "a smoke" as well... but the description makes it clear that the burning smoke is what is to be the star.  Anyway, it''s still a great shot and it includes smoke, so I''m not saying DNMC, just that it could have been stronger. IMO.', '2013-03-08 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995364, 1057054, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns and colors...</td>', 'Nice patterns and colors...', '2013-03-08 12:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995365, 1057095, 153814, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing shot and the spooky face under the spoon is a bonus.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Mesmerizing shot and the spooky face under the spoon is a bonus.Very nice.', '2013-03-08 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995366, 1056637, 49954, '<td valign="top">Oh good.  Someone remembered to do the chili pepper.  Was worried it''d be forgotten. Nice clean shot, though I''m not sure the "smoke" is playing a major role here.</td>', 'Oh good.  Someone remembered to do the chili pepper.  Was worried it''d be forgotten. Nice clean shot, though I''m not sure the "smoke" is playing a major role here.', '2013-03-08 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
