(6995403, 1056928, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic landscape, though I''m not so sure how major a role the smoke is playing.</td>', 'Nice scenic landscape, though I''m not so sure how major a role the smoke is playing.', '2013-03-08 12:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995404, 1057068, 49954, '<td valign="top">The smoke seems to be coming at him, not from him (and behind him at that... not sure the relevance of him in the photo.  That said, it is a nice shot with a lot of texture and character.</td>', 'The smoke seems to be coming at him, not from him (and behind him at that... not sure the relevance of him in the photo.  That said, it is a nice shot with a lot of texture and character.', '2013-03-08 12:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995405, 1056572, 49954, '<td valign="top">Very snapshotty to me... the tree branch (?) in the foreground distracts and the overall image is not very clear.</td>', 'Very snapshotty to me... the tree branch (?) in the foreground distracts and the overall image is not very clear.', '2013-03-08 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995406, 1057032, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but would be better if the smoke was sharp and the castle figurine was less in focus.  Also the smoke enveloping the castle would have added more dimension.  Nice work getting the moon (or facsimile) in there.</td>', 'Nice idea, but would be better if the smoke was sharp and the castle figurine was less in focus.  Also the smoke enveloping the castle would have added more dimension.  Nice work getting the moon (or facsimile) in there.', '2013-03-08 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995408, 1057073, 49954, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  Curvy.  Colorful.  Cliche.</td>', 'Pretty.  Curvy.  Colorful.  Cliche.', '2013-03-08 12:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995409, 1057012, 49954, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a bouquet of flowers to me...  A little harsh and indistinct.</td>', 'Looks more like a bouquet of flowers to me...  A little harsh and indistinct.', '2013-03-08 12:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995411, 1056705, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and attempt, however this looks too much like flame from a gas stream.  I''m sure it''s colorized smoke of course, but it''s the distraction.</td>', 'Nice idea and attempt, however this looks too much like flame from a gas stream.  I''m sure it''s colorized smoke of course, but it''s the distraction.', '2013-03-08 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995412, 1057089, 49954, '<td valign="top">Or out of focus fibers.  Or some other stand in for smoke.  It just doesn''t read as smoke as it''s toooo abstract.  Lovely colors though.</td>', 'Or out of focus fibers.  Or some other stand in for smoke.  It just doesn''t read as smoke as it''s toooo abstract.  Lovely colors though.', '2013-03-08 12:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995413, 1057022, 49954, '<td valign="top">About what we expect from this challenge.  It is lovely color and ribboning of the smoke, but it seems like it doesn''t add anything of character.</td>', 'About what we expect from this challenge.  It is lovely color and ribboning of the smoke, but it seems like it doesn''t add anything of character.', '2013-03-08 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995415, 1056911, 49954, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old man with a droopy nose to me.  Oh wait, those ARE the rolling stones.</td>', 'Looks like an old man with a droopy nose to me.  Oh wait, those ARE the rolling stones.', '2013-03-08 12:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995416, 1056072, 49954, '<td valign="top">Ah! 1979, the good (cough) old days (cough wheeze).</td>', 'Ah! 1979, the good (cough) old days (cough wheeze).', '2013-03-08 12:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995417, 1056792, 49954, '<td valign="top">Not seeing any smoke here.  I see "a smoke" or more the silhouette of one in her hand, but no "smoke" to play a major role.  The red hat and harsh shadows don''t help this either.  Selective color makes that color the star, so this is nice enough for a hat challenge.</td>', 'Not seeing any smoke here.  I see "a smoke" or more the silhouette of one in her hand, but no "smoke" to play a major role.  The red hat and harsh shadows don''t help this either.  Selective color makes that color the star, so this is nice enough for a hat challenge.', '2013-03-08 12:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995420, 1057098, 49954, '<td valign="top">Not seeing any smoke here... perhaps it''s what''s making the lady holding "a smoke" so blurry.  Wait!  Is that a wisp of smoke just near the rear tire of the passing car?  Perhaps.  But it''s not very major in the photo... Even if the theme was simply smoke (and the description did not clearly indicate "smoke" as in burning something), the cigarette is far too indistinct to be considered  "major".</td>', 'Not seeing any smoke here... perhaps it''s what''s making the lady holding "a smoke" so blurry.  Wait!  Is that a wisp of smoke just near the rear tire of the passing car?  Perhaps.  But it''s not very major in the photo... Even if the theme was simply smoke (and the description did not clearly indicate "smoke" as in burning something), the cigarette is far too indistinct to be considered  "major".', '2013-03-08 12:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995423, 1056910, 49954, '<td valign="top">Titles should not help the photo reveal itself and in this case your title does that wonderfully.  I cannot see an old woman in there, but hey, I fail Rorschach tests too.  The in your face flash is very distracting and I find I''m averting my eyes from even a photo.  Too harsh light (light smoke from the side is best I think).</td>', 'Titles should not help the photo reveal itself and in this case your title does that wonderfully.  I cannot see an old woman in there, but hey, I fail Rorschach tests too.  The in your face flash is very distracting and I find I''m averting my eyes from even a photo.  Too harsh light (light smoke from the side is best I think).', '2013-03-08 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995424, 1057097, 49954, '<td valign="top">Ok,  I see smoke here and like how it''s blending into the clouds (or creating the clouds).  Not sure  how "major" a role the smoke is playing however as this seems to be more about a construction site or plant with the smoke being secondary.</td>', 'Ok,  I see smoke here and like how it''s blending into the clouds (or creating the clouds).  Not sure  how "major" a role the smoke is playing however as this seems to be more about a construction site or plant with the smoke being secondary.', '2013-03-08 12:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995425, 1056068, 49954, '<td valign="top">Up close and personal there... the smoke needs to be more distinct I fear.  It looks like blobs of white against a man''s chin.</td>', 'Up close and personal there... the smoke needs to be more distinct I fear.  It looks like blobs of white against a man''s chin.', '2013-03-08 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995426, 1057081, 49954, '<td valign="top">Yep... more smoke.  Just there  Nice colors and waves of course, but there isn''t much interesting in this to distinguish this for the other smoke billows in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep... more smoke.  Just there  Nice colors and waves of course, but there isn''t much interesting in this to distinguish this for the other smoke billows in the challenge.', '2013-03-08 12:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995430, 1057011, 49954, '<td valign="top">CTRL-I invert!<br/> <br/>Makes a nice color and pattern and the smoke is the star of this... but like a few others, nothing unforgettable here.</td>', 'CTRL-I invert! Makes a nice color and pattern and the smoke is the star of this... but like a few others, nothing unforgettable here.', '2013-03-08 12:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995431, 1056746, 49954, '<td valign="top">OK, don''t get the title and I''m glad of that...  Otherwise it''s a very interesting concept, but the rose and butterfly seem odd in there.  If the bowl were empty it might have been better... The roughed coverlet on the table is a nice touch for added texture.  Should be faring well I bet.  Easy top 10 and probably will take red or yellow.</td>', 'OK, don''t get the title and I''m glad of that...  Otherwise it''s a very interesting concept, but the rose and butterfly seem odd in there.  If the bowl were empty it might have been better... The roughed coverlet on the table is a nice touch for added texture.  Should be faring well I bet.  Easy top 10 and probably will take red or yellow.', '2013-03-08 12:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995433, 1056805, 49954, '<td valign="top">closing time... of what?  Nothing here is distinct enough to give me any indication what the heck  is going on.</td>', 'closing time... of what?  Nothing here is distinct enough to give me any indication what the heck  is going on.', '2013-03-08 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995434, 1056998, 49954, '<td valign="top">This is a microscopic slide of a ring worm in a petri dish?  Right?  Right?  Smoke ring is too non-distinct against the background.</td>', 'This is a microscopic slide of a ring worm in a petri dish?  Right?  Right?  Smoke ring is too non-distinct against the background.', '2013-03-08 12:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995512, 1056675, 53147, '<td valign="top">Simple and straightforward. Wish there was more defined smoke coming from the cig though.</td>', 'Simple and straightforward. Wish there was more defined smoke coming from the cig though.', '2013-03-08 16:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995516, 1056834, 53147, '<td valign="top">LOL! Last comment I made was basically I wanted more smoke. This one I go the other way. Decent lighting and all but the image overall doesnt grab my attention.</td>', 'LOL! Last comment I made was basically I wanted more smoke. This one I go the other way. Decent lighting and all but the image overall doesnt grab my attention.', '2013-03-08 16:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995517, 1056072, 53147, '<td valign="top">At least this has a different feel to it. Not some run of the mill staged image. And in ''79 I was probably sitting in my familys kitchen while dad and stepmom were puffing away on their Marlboros and Camels. Such "fond" memories. ;)</td>', 'At least this has a different feel to it. Not some run of the mill staged image. And in ''79 I was probably sitting in my familys kitchen while dad and stepmom were puffing away on their Marlboros and Camels. Such "fond" memories. ;)', '2013-03-08 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995518, 1057022, 53147, '<td valign="top">So far the best straight smoke image in the challenge. Lovely softness and flow.</td>', 'So far the best straight smoke image in the challenge. Lovely softness and flow.', '2013-03-08 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995519, 1057098, 53147, '<td valign="top">Ah yes. This appeals to me. These types of images I can sit on and let my eyes wander. Best in the challenge so far.</td>', 'Ah yes. This appeals to me. These types of images I can sit on and let my eyes wander. Best in the challenge so far.', '2013-03-08 16:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995520, 1057046, 53147, '<td valign="top">Odd composition and cropping. Maybe if the smoke filled your empty space a bit more or if you had some other empty space below her cropped finger tips to balance it out better. I think you could have done something much stronger with a different pose.</td>', 'Odd composition and cropping. Maybe if the smoke filled your empty space a bit more or if you had some other empty space below her cropped finger tips to balance it out better. I think you could have done something much stronger with a different pose.', '2013-03-08 16:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995521, 1057081, 53147, '<td valign="top">Meh. Too much smoke. I think part of the particular fascination with these comes when you have a delicate thin flow of smoke that seems to have some direction. This is just a bit too much to seem "clean". That and when there are so many of these type images posted you get a bunch more to compare to.</td>', 'Meh. Too much smoke. I think part of the particular fascination with these comes when you have a delicate thin flow of smoke that seems to have some direction. This is just a bit too much to seem "clean". That and when there are so many of these type images posted you get a bunch more to compare to.', '2013-03-08 16:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995522, 1056705, 53147, '<td valign="top">The color is the grab here. Sitting here looking at it though my attention just fades away. I am trying to make more out of it, trying to interpret more of the title into the image, and it just seems like too much work. I guess its just time to vote and move on to the next similar image.</td>', 'The color is the grab here. Sitting here looking at it though my attention just fades away. I am trying to make more out of it, trying to interpret more of the title into the image, and it just seems like too much work. I guess its just time to vote and move on to the next similar image.', '2013-03-08 16:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995524, 1056805, 53147, '<td valign="top">I love a good grainy, blurry shot but I like those to have at least some sort of defintion to it. Or at least enough definition so that I can create my own story even if I dont grasp the story trying to be told. Here all I am getting is blur and grain.</td>', 'I love a good grainy, blurry shot but I like those to have at least some sort of defintion to it. Or at least enough definition so that I can create my own story even if I dont grasp the story trying to be told. Here all I am getting is blur and grain.', '2013-03-08 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995525, 1057032, 53147, '<td valign="top">I dont know what it is about shots of small statues. They dont do a whole lot for me personally. This shot probably would have benefitted from less smoke. The detailed blue smoke strands are nice but all the diffuse gray smoke that fills the rest of your black space is too much.</td>', 'I dont know what it is about shots of small statues. They dont do a whole lot for me personally. This shot probably would have benefitted from less smoke. The detailed blue smoke strands are nice but all the diffuse gray smoke that fills the rest of your black space is too much.', '2013-03-08 16:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995526, 1057012, 53147, '<td valign="top">Looks like maybe you oversharpened your smoke. i think edits that allow the smoke to stay soft and smooth work better. These type of shots just dont do it for me. Needs to be stellar to stand out, especially with so many to compare to.</td>', 'Looks like maybe you oversharpened your smoke. i think edits that allow the smoke to stay soft and smooth work better. These type of shots just dont do it for me. Needs to be stellar to stand out, especially with so many to compare to.', '2013-03-08 16:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995580, 1057097, 153814, '<td valign="top">I''m always amazed at how people could make an ugly industrial area look cool.<br/>Great job on this, it fits the challenge well and I like how the smoke blends with the clouds.</td>', 'I''m always amazed at how people could make an ugly industrial area look cool.Great job on this, it fits the challenge well and I like how the smoke blends with the clouds.', '2013-03-08 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995581, 1057022, 153814, '<td valign="top">It''s funny without reading your title I said to myself "Wow this is beautiful elegant image". I really like this there isn''t one boring spot on it. Beautiful from top to bottom. Well done.</td>', 'It''s funny without reading your title I said to myself "Wow this is beautiful elegant image". I really like this there isn''t one boring spot on it. Beautiful from top to bottom. Well done.', '2013-03-08 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995583, 1057025, 153814, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge to a "T" and I really like the PP on this.<br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Fits the challenge to a "T" and I really like the PP on this.Very nice.', '2013-03-08 18:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995585, 1057012, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very mesmerizing image you have here.<br/>It''s like there''s a message in the smoke but I can''t find it.<br/>I''m going to keep looking though until I find it.<br/>Well done, ya got me thinking.</td>', 'Very mesmerizing image you have here.It''s like there''s a message in the smoke but I can''t find it.I''m going to keep looking though until I find it.Well done, ya got me thinking.', '2013-03-08 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995587, 1056932, 153814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image it has an ominous look to it like a Hansel and Gretel feel.<br/>I suck at explaining these things I hope you understand what I''m trying to say.</td>', 'Beautiful image it has an ominous look to it like a Hansel and Gretel feel.I suck at explaining these things I hope you understand what I''m trying to say.', '2013-03-08 18:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995616, 1056174, 53147, '<td valign="top">My wife would probably be ticked at this image and its relation to smoke. If its from a power plant then this is more likely steam. I wish you had more of the stacks in the image. Maybe there were too many distractions below. ETA - so I showed it to my wife and she wasn''t familiar with the type of stack but she did correct me in that it wouldn''t be steam but water vapor. ;) water vapor, steam or smoke, did t impact my vote.</td>', 'My wife would probably be ticked at this image and its relation to smoke. If its from a power plant then this is more likely steam. I wish you had more of the stacks in the image. Maybe there were too many distractions below. ETA - so I showed it to my wife and she wasn''t familiar with the type of stack but she did correct me in that it wouldn''t be steam but water vapor. ;) water vapor, steam or smoke, did t impact my vote.', '2013-03-08 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995641, 1056932, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!! I like how the smoke and the sunlight interact with one another! Quite lovely!</td>', 'Very nice composition!! I like how the smoke and the sunlight interact with one another! Quite lovely!', '2013-03-08 20:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995642, 1057073, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely spirals and choice of color gradient. Very simple, yet elegant!</td>', 'Lovely spirals and choice of color gradient. Very simple, yet elegant!', '2013-03-08 20:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995643, 1056852, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. Great detail in the pot! I wish the color steam was a little different...for some reason the vivid blue/purple doesn''t fit for me. Still, a great image!</td>', 'Very nicely composed. Great detail in the pot! I wish the color steam was a little different...for some reason the vivid blue/purple doesn''t fit for me. Still, a great image!', '2013-03-08 20:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995644, 1056928, 124982, '<td valign="top">A nice break from the incense images! This is a beautiful urban landscape-y kind of image. Wish the smoke (and the source of the smoke) was more prominent though.</td>', 'A nice break from the incense images! This is a beautiful urban landscape-y kind of image. Wish the smoke (and the source of the smoke) was more prominent though.', '2013-03-08 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995645, 1057038, 124982, '<td valign="top">Simple, understated and relaxing. Nothing overprocessed or overdone.</td>', 'Simple, understated and relaxing. Nothing overprocessed or overdone.', '2013-03-08 20:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995646, 1056834, 124982, '<td valign="top">There''s smoke, there''s the statue, and there''s the incense stick. Problem is, I don''t know where to lool -- there''s no real focal point. Less is more, maybe?</td>', 'There''s smoke, there''s the statue, and there''s the incense stick. Problem is, I don''t know where to lool -- there''s no real focal point. Less is more, maybe?', '2013-03-08 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995647, 1057074, 124982, '<td valign="top">Inferno it is!! That''s some real smoke...not some incense smoke! Pity the composition is lacking a wee bit ... nothing that really excites the eye.</td>', 'Inferno it is!! That''s some real smoke...not some incense smoke! Pity the composition is lacking a wee bit ... nothing that really excites the eye.', '2013-03-08 20:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995648, 1056746, 124982, '<td valign="top">Well now, I''m curious to how how this was done! The butterfly and rose make this -- steal the show from the smoke almost! Definitely a Top3 for me.</td>', 'Well now, I''m curious to how how this was done! The butterfly and rose make this -- steal the show from the smoke almost! Definitely a Top3 for me.', '2013-03-08 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995649, 1057054, 124982, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition in the smoke. And who doesn''t like purple and blue? Nicely done!</td>', 'Nice repetition in the smoke. And who doesn''t like purple and blue? Nicely done!', '2013-03-08 20:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995651, 1057012, 124982, '<td valign="top">Add a little red in there and you have the good ol'' red white and blue! Nice smoke trail and attractive blue.</td>', 'Add a little red in there and you have the good ol'' red white and blue! Nice smoke trail and attractive blue.', '2013-03-08 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995652, 1056637, 124982, '<td valign="top">I will be very surprised if this is not an Oliver image!! Perfectly composed and lit. Not a thing I can find wrong with this. I suspect this is the Blue Winner.</td>', 'I will be very surprised if this is not an Oliver image!! Perfectly composed and lit. Not a thing I can find wrong with this. I suspect this is the Blue Winner.', '2013-03-08 20:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995653, 1056805, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very abstract image -- but makes a pleasing break from the highly colorized images (mine included) in this challenge! Should appeal to the alternative crowd.</td>', 'Very abstract image -- but makes a pleasing break from the highly colorized images (mine included) in this challenge! Should appeal to the alternative crowd.', '2013-03-08 20:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995654, 1057022, 124982, '<td valign="top">Something so mellow and relaxing about this smoke trail. Very clean and nicely done!</td>', 'Something so mellow and relaxing about this smoke trail. Very clean and nicely done!', '2013-03-08 20:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995655, 1057098, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite mysterious...taken several looks to "piece this puzzle" together. Many layers provide lots of viewer interest!</td>', 'Quite mysterious...taken several looks to "piece this puzzle" together. Many layers provide lots of viewer interest!', '2013-03-08 20:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995657, 1056792, 124982, '<td valign="top">You know, I like everything about this image. The red hat, the shadow, the pose. It all works for me. I suspect though that the voters are giving you a hard time about the lack of in-your-face smoke in this? Still, I overlooked that. 8.</td>', 'You know, I like everything about this image. The red hat, the shadow, the pose. It all works for me. I suspect though that the voters are giving you a hard time about the lack of in-your-face smoke in this? Still, I overlooked that. 8.', '2013-03-08 20:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995658, 1057095, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very soothing browns, and clever use of the spoon and inverted perspective! Very nicely done!</td>', 'Very soothing browns, and clever use of the spoon and inverted perspective! Very nicely done!', '2013-03-08 20:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995659, 1057011, 124982, '<td valign="top">A vigorous, aggressively spreading smoke-trail!! Very interesting patterns. Very sharp.</td>', 'A vigorous, aggressively spreading smoke-trail!! Very interesting patterns. Very sharp.', '2013-03-08 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995660, 1056705, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a bizarre shape! Definitely has some movement to it -- well titled!</td>', 'Such a bizarre shape! Definitely has some movement to it -- well titled!', '2013-03-08 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6995661, 1056174, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lots of smoke for sure -- ugh, pollution. Wish the crop wasnt so tight though, and you got more of the building in.</td>', 'Lots of smoke for sure -- ugh, pollution. Wish the crop wasnt so tight though, and you got more of the building in.', '2013-03-08 20:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
