(6995893, 1057068, 124982, '<td valign="top">A nice personal touch..makes a nice break from the manufactured "studio" shots prevalent in this challenge (mine included). Wish there was touch more detail and a little less grit/grain in the face. But I suspect that is what you were going for?</td>', 'A nice personal touch..makes a nice break from the manufactured "studio" shots prevalent in this challenge (mine included). Wish there was touch more detail and a little less grit/grain in the face. But I suspect that is what you were going for?', '2013-03-09 13:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
