(6995895, 1056572, 124982, '<td valign="top">Almost looks cartoony! Not sure how that effect was achieved? Wish it was cropped a little tighter to the man and the fire/fireworks. The tree on the left is somewhat distracting and doesn''t really add anything to the image.</td>', 'Almost looks cartoony! Not sure how that effect was achieved? Wish it was cropped a little tighter to the man and the fire/fireworks. The tree on the left is somewhat distracting and doesn''t really add anything to the image.', '2013-03-09 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1);
