(6996579, 1056792, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice Vision. I had to come back to this to comment on the composition. It looks like you used rule of thirds to put her face in the top left third of the shot. In this case, I think a stronger composition would have been to throw rule of thirds out the window and crop off the top and left part of the shot, putting her more to the left edge. This would have left the two elements of the shot (the girl and the year) on opposite sides of the shot, creating a stronger composition.</td>', 'Nice Vision. I had to come back to this to comment on the composition. It looks like you used rule of thirds to put her face in the top left third of the shot. In this case, I think a stronger composition would have been to throw rule of thirds out the window and crop off the top and left part of the shot, putting her more to the left edge. This would have left the two elements of the shot (the girl and the year) on opposite sides of the shot, creating a stronger composition.', '2013-03-10 18:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
