(6999787, 1057046, 94815, '<td valign="top">Confusing to me - what is she pulling (or "pull" as in tasking a drag of the ciragette). Or is she pulling the thing in her left hand - kinda looks like a sailboat tiller but can''t be. (I wish we could see it.) I like the light, the smoke is good, but the situation including the contemptuous expression is incomprehensible. Best my head can make of it is that we the viewers are in a precarious situation, and she is about to pull the lever that sends us to oblivion... or something. I''m blabbering on in frustration because the shot is too well done not to have some specific idea behind it. Hoping the story is revealed, I remain..</td>', 'Confusing to me - what is she pulling (or "pull" as in tasking a drag of the ciragette). Or is she pulling the thing in her left hand - kinda looks like a sailboat tiller but can''t be. (I wish we could see it.) I like the light, the smoke is good, but the situation including the contemptuous expression is incomprehensible. Best my head can make of it is that we the viewers are in a precarious situation, and she is about to pull the lever that sends us to oblivion... or something. I''m blabbering on in frustration because the shot is too well done not to have some specific idea behind it. Hoping the story is revealed, I remain..', '2013-03-14 11:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
